=== load
--- calls
python3
  <TMP>/w-svb/tree/collectors/svb/load.py
  --bronze-dir
  <TMP>/w-svb/xdgdata/wealthdb/svb/bronze
  --silver-db
  <TMP>/w-svb/xdgdata/wealthdb/svb/svb.db
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
=== download
--- calls
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
svb: no-op. This collector has no live source — the SVB statements are a fixed
historical archive (SVB wound down in 2023). Drop the in-scope statement PDFs
(+ an optional signature.txt page-1 guard, and the derived-marks.xlsx
performance workbook of month-end account values for the months the
statements do not cover) into <data-dir>/bronze/ (default
$XDG_DATA_HOME/wealthdb/svb/bronze/), in whatever folder layout suits — load
searches it recursively — then run `wealthdb-collect svb load` to rebuild the silver DBs from
them.
